        "category": "filing",
        "authority": "Cuyahoga County Fiscal Office, Lodging Occupancy Tax Office",
        "description": "The county tax is 6.5% of gross short-term rent, including non-optional fees. Register and get approved first, then file monthly online through the county's GovOS portal by the 21st of the month after the period; a form is required even for months with no rentals. Late: 10% penalty plus 3% monthly interest. Phone 216-443-7140.",
